== Interactions ==
* {{i|Godhead}}: Tears will take longer to hit enemies, increasing the damage dealt by the aura.
* {{i|The Ludovico Technique}}: Decreased shot speed makes it harder to keep the tear on enemies.
* {{i|Trisagion}}: Because Trisagion can hit the same enemy multiple times, lower shot speed results in a substantial DPS increase.
* {{dlc|nr}} {{i|My Reflection}} / {{i|Pop!}} / {{i|Lachryphagy}}: Decreases effective range.

